 Presentation Layer
feature/
├── dashboard/
├── activity/
├── insights/
└── profile/

Contains:

Compose screens
ViewModels
UI state
UI events
Navigation

The presentation layer does not directly communicate with Google Fit or Room.


 Domain Layer

domain/
├── model/
├── repository/
└── usecase/

Example use cases:
GetDailyActivity
GetActivityHistory
CalculateFitnessSummary
GetFitnessInsights
SynchronizeFitnessData


Data Layer
data/
├── local/
├── fitness/
├── repository/
└── synchronization/

Responsibilities:

Local persistence
Fitness provider integration
Repository implementations
Synchronization
